Note this is a number guessing game end note.
Set secret to random number from 1 to 20.
Set tries to 0.
Say text I am thinking of a number from 1 to 20. end text
Set found to no.
While found is equal to no,
  Ask the user for a number called guess.
  Change tries by 1.
  If guess is equal to secret, then
    Say text You got it in end text, tries, text tries. end text
    Set found to yes.
  otherwise if guess is less than secret, then
    Say text Too low. end text
  otherwise
    Say text Too high. end text
  end if.
end loop.
